# No tool attribution in git

Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made with Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, `cursoragent@cursor.com`, or any Cursor/AI trailer to commit messages, `git notes`, or PR bodies.

When committing, use only the subject/body you wrote. Do not pass `--trailer`. If a cherry-pick, amend, or reused message already contains those trailers, strip them before creating the new commit.

Do not mention Cursor, the agent, or AI tooling in commit messages or PR descriptions.